{"title":"Combined feed","url":"https://Vinnl.github.io/feeds/all.xml","elements":[{"title":"Albert E. Boynton (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that California progressive-era politician <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_E._Boynton\" title=\"Albert E. Boynton\">Albert E. Boynton</a></b> <i>(pictured)</i> worked with future governor <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/C._C._Young\" title=\"C. C. Young\">C.&nbsp;C. Young</a> to write a bill that introduced secret ballots for elections, abolishing old \"party-line\" ballots?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Albert_E._Boynton","retrieved":1788379278708},{"title":"telephone transmission (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that the cost of providing <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carrier_telephony\" title=\"Carrier telephony\">telephone transmission</a></b> in the US decreased by a factor of one thousand from 1925 to 1975?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carrier_telephony","retrieved":1788379278711},{"title":"Thomas Duke (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Duke\" title=\"Thomas Duke\">Thomas Duke</a></b> is known for finding and photographing the filming locations of famous films?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Thomas_Duke","retrieved":1788379278717},{"title":"CasaNem (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that a building occupied by <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CasaNem\" title=\"CasaNem\">CasaNem</a></b> contained works of art, including a bust of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Alberto_Santos-Dumont\" title=\"Alberto Santos-Dumont\">Santos-Dumont</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/CasaNem","retrieved":1788379278719},{"title":"Liew Mun Leong (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liew_Mun_Leong\" title=\"Liew Mun Leong\">Liew Mun Leong</a></b> started his career by developing military camps before becoming the chief project manager for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Infrastructure_of_Changi_Airport#Terminal_2\" title=\"Infrastructure of Changi Airport\">Changi Airport Terminal<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>2</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Liew_Mun_Leong","retrieved":1788379278721},{"title":"Meat Grinder (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that Thai censors considered <i><b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meat_Grinder\" title=\"Meat Grinder\">Meat Grinder</a></b></i> a national-security concern because of its portrayal of human flesh being used in noodles and scenes related to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/6_October_1976_massacre\" title=\"6 October 1976 massacre\">6&nbsp;October 1976 massacre</a>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meat_Grinder","retrieved":1788379278722},{"title":"June 1989 Greek parliamentary election (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that alleged pornographic pictures of candidates and their mistresses was part of public discourse during the <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_1989_Greek_parliamentary_election\" title=\"June 1989 Greek parliamentary election\">June<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">&nbsp;</span>1989 Greek parliamentary election</a></b>?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/June_1989_Greek_parliamentary_election","retrieved":1788379278724},{"title":"Mitsue Yamazaki (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitsue_Yamazaki\" title=\"Mitsue Yamazaki\">Mitsue Yamazaki</a></b> named an anime television series she co-created after a term that \"makes people in the industry shudder\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitsue_Yamazaki","retrieved":1788379278725},{"title":"gooners (Wikipedia — did you know?)","contents":"... that <b><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gooning\" title=\"Gooning\">gooners</a></b> can reach a \"goon state\" in their \"goon caves\"?","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gooning","retrieved":1788379278727},{"title":"Destination of the Month (Wikivoyage recommendations)","contents":"<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt8\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\" id=\"mwIQ\" data-mw=\"{&quot;parts&quot;:[{&quot;template&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;banner&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:&quot;./Template:Banner&quot;},&quot;params&quot;:{&quot;direction&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;left&quot;},&quot;title&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;St. John's&quot;},&quot;type&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;dotm&quot;},&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;BannerStJohns1.jpg&quot;},&quot;quote&quot;:{&quot;wt&quot;:&quot;Colourful houses and military history await you in Canada's oldest and easternmost city.&quot;}},&quot;i&quot;:0}}]}\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4523569\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles\" about=\"#mwt9\" data-mw=\"{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;templatestyles&quot;,&quot;attrs&quot;:{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;Banner/styles.css&quot;}}\">.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox{color:white;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h2,.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox h3{color:white;border:none;font-family:sans-serif;line-height:1.2em;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .mainpage-shadowbox a{color:white;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .banner-image{position:relative;max-width:1125px;height:auto;margin-bottom:.6em}.mw-parser-output .banner-image img{max-width:100%;height:auto}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-wide{width:80%}.mw-parser-output .banner-box-left,.mw-parser-output .banner-box-right{padding:8px 7px;background:rgb(16,16,16);background:rgba(0,0,0,0.3);border-radius:4px;width:40%}.mw-